-- 22(4): costs.  Costs Facts: damages awarded, the sum offered in writing, date of the occurrence, date the action was
-- commenced, date the offer was made.
`damages of 100 after an offer of 100 made at 6 months exactly` MEANS `Costs Facts` OF 100, JUST 100, YMD 2026 1 15, YMD 2026 12 1, JUST (YMD 2026 7 15)
`damages of 100 after an offer of 100 made a day after 6 months but before the action` MEANS `Costs Facts` OF 100, JUST 100, YMD 2026 1 15, YMD 2026 12 1, JUST (YMD 2026 7 16)
`damages of 100 after an offer of 100 made after 6 months and after the action` MEANS `Costs Facts` OF 100, JUST 100, YMD 2026 1 15, YMD 2026 7 20, JUST (YMD 2026 7 21)
`damages of 150 after an offer of 100 made in time` MEANS `Costs Facts` OF 150, JUST 100, YMD 2026 1 15, YMD 2026 12 1, JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)
`damages of 90 after an offer of 100 made in time` MEANS `Costs Facts` OF 90,  JUST 100, YMD 2026 1 15, YMD 2026 12 1, JUST (YMD 2026 3 1)
`damages of 100 with no offer` MEANS `Costs Facts` OF 100, NOTHING, YMD 2026 1 15, YMD 2026 12 1, NOTHING

