#ASSERT `the carrier's offer was made in time` `damages of 100 after an offer of 100 made a day after 6 months but before the action`
#ASSERT NOT `the carrier's offer was made in time` `damages of 100 after an offer of 100 made after 6 months and after the action`
#ASSERT NOT `the carrier's offer was made in time` `damages of 100 with no offer`
