-- Servant Limit Facts: an action against a servant or agent, he proves he acted within his employment, amount from the
-- carrier, amount from servants and agents.
`an action against a servant who acted within employment` MEANS `Servant Limit Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  0,       0
`an action against a servant who cannot prove it` MEANS `Servant Limit Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, 0,       0
`no action against a servant` MEANS `Servant Limit Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE,  0,       0

