#ASSERT NOT `the aggregate recoverable from the carrier and his servants and agents is within the limit` (`Servant Limit Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, 200_000, 50_001) 250_000

§§ `Article 26. Complaint`

-- Complaint Facts: kind, date of receipt or of being placed at disposal, date the damage was discovered, date the complaint
-- was made, forthwith, in writing, the carrier's fraud.
`baggage damage, received 1 March, complaint on the 3rd day` MEANS `Complaint Facts` OF `damage to baggage`, YMD 2026 3 1, YMD 2026 3 1, YMD 2026 3 4,  TRUE,  TRUE, FALSE
`baggage damage, received 1 March, complaint on the 4th day` MEANS `Complaint Facts` OF `damage to baggage`, YMD 2026 3 1, YMD 2026 3 1, YMD 2026 3 5,  TRUE,  TRUE, FALSE
`baggage damage, received 1 March, complaint on the 7th day` MEANS `Complaint Facts` OF `damage to baggage`, YMD 2026 3 1, YMD 2026 3 1, YMD 2026 3 8,  TRUE,  TRUE, FALSE
`baggage damage, received 1 March, complaint on the 8th day` MEANS `Complaint Facts` OF `damage to baggage`, YMD 2026 3 1, YMD 2026 3 1, YMD 2026 3 9,  TRUE,  TRUE, FALSE
