§§ `Article 29. Time for bringing an action`

`arrived on 1 March 2024` MEANS `the aircraft arrived at the destination` (YMD 2024 3 1)
`ought to have arrived on 1 March 2024` MEANS `the aircraft did not arrive` (YMD 2024 3 1)
`stopped on 1 March 2024` MEANS `the carriage stopped` (YMD 2024 3 1)
`stopped on 29 February 2024` MEANS `the carriage stopped` (YMD 2024 2 29)

#ASSERT `the date from which the two years run` `arrived on 1 March 2024` EQUALS YMD 2024 3 1
#ASSERT `the date from which the two years run` `ought to have arrived on 1 March 2024` EQUALS YMD 2024 3 1
#ASSERT `the date from which the two years run` `stopped on 1 March 2024` EQUALS YMD 2024 3 1
#ASSERT `the last day for bringing the action` `arrived on 1 March 2024` EQUALS YMD 2026 3 1
#ASSERT NOT `the right to damages is extinguished` (`Limitation Facts` OF `arrived on 1 March 2024`, YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT `the right to damages is extinguished` (`Limitation Facts` OF `arrived on 1 March 2024`, YMD 2026 3 2)
#ASSERT NOT `the right to damages is extinguished` (`Limitation Facts` OF `ought to have arrived on 1 March 2024`, YMD 2026 3 1)
#ASSERT `the right to damages is extinguished` (`Limitation Facts` OF `stopped on 1 March 2024`, YMD 2026 3 2)
-- two years after 29 February 2024 is taken as 28 February 2026 (NOTES.md fork F6)
#ASSERT `the last day for bringing the action` `stopped on 29 February 2024` EQUALS YMD 2026 2 28
#ASSERT `the right to damages is extinguished` (`Limitation Facts` OF `stopped on 29 February 2024`, YMD 2026 3 1)

§§ `Article 30. Successive carriers`

-- Successive Action Facts: several successive carriers within Article 1(3), the carrier accepted the thing carried,
-- claimant, what the claim concerns, the carrier's position, the first carrier assumed liability for the whole journey.
`the first carrier in a passenger claim, no assumption of liability` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, `the passenger or the passenger's representative`, `a passenger`, `the first carrier`, FALSE
`the first carrier in a passenger claim, with an express assumption of liability` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, `the passenger or the passenger's representative`, `a passenger`, `the first carrier`, TRUE
`the carrier of the stage where the accident occurred` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, `the passenger or the passenger's representative`, `a passenger`, `the carrier who performed the carriage during which the accident or the delay occurred`, FALSE
`another carrier in a passenger claim` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, `the passenger or the passenger's representative`, `a passenger`, `another carrier`, FALSE
`the consignor against the first carrier` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, `the consignor`, `cargo`, `the first carrier`, FALSE
`the consignor against the last carrier` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, `the consignor`, `cargo`, `the last carrier`, FALSE
`the consignee against the last carrier` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, `the consignee who is entitled to delivery`, `cargo`, `the last carrier`, FALSE
`the consignee against the first carrier` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, `the consignee who is entitled to delivery`, `cargo`, `the first carrier`, FALSE
`the consignee against the carrier where the loss occurred` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, `the consignee who is entitled to delivery`, `cargo`, `the carrier who performed the carriage during which the destruction, loss, damage or delay took place`, FALSE
`a passenger against the first carrier for baggage` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, `the passenger or the passenger's representative`, `registered baggage`, `the first carrier`, FALSE
`a passenger against the last carrier for baggage` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, `the passenger or the passenger's representative`, `registered baggage`, `the last carrier`, FALSE
`the carriage is not successive carriage` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, `the consignor`, `cargo`, `the first carrier`, FALSE
`a carrier that did not accept anything` MEANS `Successive Action Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, `the consignor`, `cargo`, `the first carrier`, FALSE

